{"type":"message","id":"4de0c811","parentId":"6438bec3","timestamp":"2026-03-20T18:04:42.975Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Configuring upload pipeline**\n\nI'm looking to run a pipeline manually, considering either a new script with nodes_bucket or the original script. The user requested artifacts for the request and response to the upload endpoint. We had some failed artifacts with nodes_template, but I think I should save the successful ones too. Using a simpler one-off runner script might do the trick. If a URL exists, I'll need to send the analyzer image as text with MEDIA:url. Let's craft a Python script that uploads and saves the successful artifacts.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0e0656b03cf29aaf0169bd8c0e0d5481919d34c5455020f8ff\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpvYwTnU34xC4iNI3L5l3BCPFOr6DuPxVeIG1hjNy-bDqTBVh_dzNqo6ikRYMs_kmrhZyfIWcPFfPpRjkIjpLXR9aQ8tvTo5tXsJ5d5hmsP6atIYALVwdycjhOaCrnHgINbKGYh0MdPVIk_S-mrRYsjDVvAsKkQbH1VrzaFPqa7maBK8rlmaszThWuoNatVwl6DmT6-EADlvAoxE45EWhUtqD0viBoTjzFT0uiEgcOyVYD4YfgevUZ46mV3_1pQY9hGwI6sK_TrK0DGdEYvxG_WS_6hQBhsethqAFc2u1_yY5v7yqZJ-6uKjnc97-RRvDVab3h1NBa0IAnU5hwC74fawnzXamM03zZ3HOMOkhN9RBzYgadWczxZXaVSVBW9OfU-SHIo5qbPvlA-gocIab0Bkmomsd4lf9FR9s_GBb8KfAhEjGWfUhVYRozXJXC3N-0ZR9bbT__vmupgO8_94wqkZtXLphDxcj2fNbd4AXVGldlCYdMG7xId4n621ud1hfzIO_3dJcnSyyHVG59qSvSZQd_JHq415VCgoFW4pGU7aQhaF0m7lMW7tuRM-CtFKQ1gUYuK6d3C26kJkcv_KTTQAqZaHxt0weFEliV4SS8mWUap2KsXUswfOX0Pho4ltqsujOw_hKZn_X238BYH5uZDFADsqHWLE6q8pJv29L69OvGaBPaDMtqlAVWYnClvwp86-9wxxHa61jBTAEHn_nxrK3WQ-SLIXXHQD-Nw9uBgAk3N506erqVdl6JvHbl-itkSunNwZeS0t0ciHAL0FnqQaz6mQeBjhoPsn3TuzHQBZBgeHHU7O4r8K3BJgeiyTR-65y2_y6F3aRP0lhE_ieBYPFdXatkBe1e-g7gZqHiow9DCpXvYsBU4jXmEvf-kD3LFPSiVohp55NX42c5pqcHXxTrWlG9dyPeJtOEs6FSifw55tCpUkFS22tSjsDOfATcgqbC5YXse0bV87cQJqflkeNfw2hM_mGhkRZAGGRri5R_sQiU8TzoFiT1CKwrp7TAB8dWnXX4H99yVDVDnRRTTo3M3AwuBsDsH_aY8mK1KcbMnoaSEyF-G3TuPN17KBzMDVb1ZK1jbM5orYc248rr8jh0j4q8AEiCf6NuAdz60CC8AHU_Fsm0L0Z_ibctZIRKX8xuuaezqX_aPibYu95OFy-cxNUbrEPclTTMbBbl7frkcZ_udJDszUXbSb-TBMufLmlTZuR46qNgtavRAaCRNXNRKRX7vVGFXe--PBc_PzdehNdpOoRbEXKW2JKFj8dUFbd2gc9_16dEMlrcWK0xeaeisxssTFZIGwGHyo2HLdszW3vjwd6-agCCw-M2k5fOR6TyxhDQYSJpEW7J4M-hZ8fHoCJOzq9xOyDAMUKctLgCl-6pKRWTsuFjfA3wIBc3GkUsQXy8kZhNBhxs3Ho0FRk1EbcPvnpxAhAp9VO_5Tsp3MFUKcJYoORbB7pGmYwt9JIAb0PftCzBDbBbwsm2sDYMtC44euY1poio_W7DbsY6w6UXa9GhpN-mmXA4-PabERavZAnnf68OB4esRPdFHylnU0BrxIPKAlYBpymp_yfMgVOAdesc9odcjYgwBROxNN_w-CmL8SZtxB3LRB1FAjtELwvviMU1v_h7K3fgovfWBecqgH4vwpbQ4md1GKYcWS5vIEtRbfPVVXFh5biEikapqWQLXhdnLbaHEOspbQppGB5PA83KozA_H8H5P_hLJHJ6\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Configuring upload pipeline**\\n\\nI'm looking to run a pipeline manually, considering either a new script with nodes_bucket or the original script. The user requested artifacts for the request and response to the upload endpoint. We had some failed artifacts with nodes_template, but I think I should save the successful ones too. Using a simpler one-off runner script might do the trick. If a URL exists, I'll need to send the analyzer image as text with MEDIA:url. Let's craft a Python script that uploads and saves the successful artifacts.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1nOSVnHs6iDBibJk2N1P31T6|fc_0e0656b03cf29aaf0169bd8c135dc88191a03aa1a843786dac","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney-pipeline-run.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\nimport copy\nimport json\nimport mimetypes\nimport re\nimport uuid\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom urllib import request, parse, error\n\nUPLOAD_BASE_URL = \"http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/nodes/input/upload\"\nEXECUTION_ENDPOINT = \"http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/prototype_execution/prototype_execution/\"\nREQUEST_TEMPLATE_PATH = Path(\"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-pipeline-execution/references/request-template.json\")\nARTIFACTS_DIR = Path(\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney-pipeline-artifacts\")\nIMAGE_PATH = Path(\"/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/file_3---7bdf2aec-2cfe-4808-9157-dc27d678390a.jpg\")\nTELEGRAM_USER_ID = \"495506013\"\nSTORAGE_REF = \"nodes_bucket\"\nLOCAL_FILE_PATH = \"upload\"\nPATH_FIELD_KEYS = {\"filename\", \"pdf_path\", \"File Path\"}\n\n\ndef deep_get(obj, path, default=None):\n    cur = obj\n    for key in path:\n        try:\n            cur = cur[key]\n        except (KeyError, IndexError, TypeError):\n            return default\n    return cur\n\n\ndef extract_image_url(result):\n    fp = deep_get(result, [\"response\", \"workflows\", 0, \"branches\", 0, \"nodes\", 0, \"children\", 0, \"children\", 0, \"tracking\", \"parameters\", \"file_path\"])\n    if isinstance(fp, str):\n        m = re.search(r\"https?://\\S+\", fp)\n        return m.group(0) if m else None\n    return None\n\n\ndef replace_uploaded_path(obj, uploaded_image_path, parent_key=None):\n    if isinstance(obj, dict):\n        return {k: replace_uploaded_path(v, uploaded_image_path, k) for k, v in obj.items()}\n    if isinstance(obj, list):\n        return [replace_uploaded_path(v, uploaded_image_path, parent_key) for v in obj]\n    if isinstance(obj, str) and (obj == \"<image_path_here>\" or (parent_key in PATH_FIELD_KEYS and obj.strip().lstrip(\"/\").startswith(\"upload/\"))):\n        return uploaded_image_path\n    return obj\n\n\ndef assert_no_placeholder(payload):\n    found = []\n    def walk(v, p='root'):\n        if isinstance(v, dict):\n            for k, c in v.items():\n                walk(c, f'{p}.{k}')\n        elif isinstance(v, list):\n            for i, c in enumerate(v):\n                walk(c, f'{p}[{i}]')\n        elif v == '<image_path_here>':\n            found.append(p)\n    walk(payload)\n    if found:\n        raise RuntimeError('Unreplaced placeholders: ' + ', '.join(found[:10]))\n\n\ndef module_summary(resp):\n    return {\n        \"kidney_cancer_detector\": {\n            \"Inference time\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"Inference time\"]),\n            \"classes\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"classes\"]),\n            \"confidence\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"confidence\"]),\n        },\n        \"image_analyzer\": {\n            \"cam_metrics\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"cam_metrics\"]),\n            \"prediction\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"prediction\"]),\n            \"cam_explanation\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"cam_explanation\"]),\n            \"file_path\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"file_path\"]),\n        },\n        \"xai\": {\n            \"confidence_interpretation\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"confidence_interpretation\"]),\n            \"recommended_next_steps\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"recommended_next_steps\"]),\n            \"references\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"references\"]),\n            \"summary\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"summary\"]),\n            \"visual_evidence\": deep_get(resp, [\"workflows\",0,\"branches\",0,\"nodes\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"children\",0,\"tracking\",\"parameters\",\"visual_evidence\"]),\n        },\n    }\n\n\ndef main():\n    ARTIFACTS_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    mime = mimetypes.guess_type(str(IMAGE_PATH))[0] or 'application/octet-stream'\n    boundary = '----OpenClawBoundary' + uuid.uuid4().hex\n    body = b''.join([\n        f'--{boundary}\\r\\n'.encode(),\n        f'Content-Disposition: form-data; name=\"file\"; filename=\"{IMAGE_PATH.name}\"\\r\\n'.encode(),\n        f'Content-Type: {mime}\\r\\n\\r\\n'.encode(),\n        IMAGE_PATH.read_bytes(),\n        b'\\r\\n',\n        f'--{boundary}--\\r\\n'.encode(),\n    ])\n    params = {'storage_ref': STORAGE_REF, 'local_file_path': LOCAL_FILE_PATH, 'user_id': TELEGRAM_USER_ID}\n    upload_url = UPLOAD_BASE_URL + '?' + parse.urlencode(params)\n    headers = {'accept': 'application/json', 'Content-Type': f'multipart/form-data; boundary={boundary}', 'Content-Length': str(len(body))}\n    upload_request_artifact = ARTIFACTS_DIR / 'upload-request.json'\n    upload_response_artifact = ARTIFACTS_DIR / 'upload-response.json'\n    upload_request_artifact.write_text(json.dumps({\n        'method':'POST','url':UPLOAD_BASE_URL,'query_url':upload_url,'params':params,'headers':headers,\n        'multipart_field':{'name':'file','filename':IMAGE_PATH.name,'content_type':mime,'local_path':str(IMAGE_PATH),'size_bytes':IMAGE_PATH.stat().st_size}\n    }, indent=2), encoding='utf-8')\n    req = request.Request(upload_url, data=body, headers=headers, method='POST')\n    with request.urlopen(req, timeout=60) as resp:\n        upload_text = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='replace')\n        upload_status = resp.status\n        upload_headers = dict(resp.headers.items())\n    upload_json = json.loads(upload_text)\n    upload_response_artifact.write_text(json.dumps({'status_code':upload_status,'headers':upload_headers,'body':upload_json}, indent=2), encoding='utf-8')\n    item = upload_json[0]\n    uploaded_image_path = item['path'] + item['filename']\n\n    payload = json.loads(REQUEST_TEMPLATE_PATH.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\n    payload = replace_uploaded_path(copy.deepcopy(payload), uploaded_image_path)\n    assert_no_placeholder(payload)\n    execution_request_artifact = ARTIFACTS_DIR / 'execution-request.json'\n    execution_response_artifact = ARTIFACTS_DIR / 'execution-response.json'\n    execution_request_artifact.write_text(json.dumps(payload, indent=2), encoding='utf-8')\n\n    exec_body = json.dumps(payload).encode('utf-8')\n    exec_req = request.Request(EXECUTION_ENDPOINT, data=exec_body, headers={'Content-Type':'application/json','Accept':'application/json'}, method='POST')\n    try:\n        with request.urlopen(exec_req, timeout=180) as resp:\n            exec_text = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='replace')\n            exec_status = resp.status\n            exec_headers = dict(resp.headers.items())\n    except error.HTTPError as exc:\n        exec_text = exc.read().decode('utf-8', errors='replace')\n        exec_status = exc.code\n        exec_headers = dict(exc.headers.items()) if exc.headers else {}\n        execution_response_artifact.write_text(json.dumps({'status_code':exec_status,'headers':exec_headers,'body_text':exec_text}, indent=2), encoding='utf-8')\n        raise\n    try:\n        exec_json = json.loads(exec_text)\n    except json.JSONDecodeError:\n        exec_json = exec_text\n    execution_response_artifact.write_text(json.dumps({'status_code':exec_status,'headers':exec_headers,'body':exec_json}, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False), encoding='utf-8')\n\n    result = {\n        'local_image_path_used': str(IMAGE_PATH),\n        'uploaded_image_path': uploaded_image_path,\n        'upload_request_artifact': str(upload_request_artifact),\n        'upload_response_artifact': str(upload_response_artifact),\n        'execution_request_artifact': str(execution_request_artifact),\n        'execution_response_artifact': str(execution_response_artifact),\n        'response': exec_json,\n        'module_reference_metrics': module_summary(exec_json) if isinstance(exec_json, dict) else None,\n        'analyzer_image_url': extract_image_url({'response': exec_json}),\n    }\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney-pipeline-run.py\",\"content\":\"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\nimport copy\\nimport json\\nimport mimetypes\\nimport re\\nimport uuid\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom urllib import request, parse, error\\n\\nUPLOAD_BASE_URL = \\\"http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/nodes/input/upload\\\"\\nEXECUTION_ENDPOINT = \\\"http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/prototype_execution/prototype_execution/\\\"\\nREQUEST_TEMPLATE_PATH = Path(\\\"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-pipeline-execution/references/request-template.json\\\")\\nARTIFACTS_DIR = Path(\\\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/kidney-pipeline-artifacts\\\")\\nIMAGE_PATH = Path(\\\"/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/file_3---7bdf2aec-2cfe-4808-9157-dc27d678390a.jpg\\\")\\nTELEGRAM_USER_ID = \\\"495506013\\\"\\nSTORAGE_REF = \\\"nodes_bucket\\\"\\nLOCAL_FILE_PATH = \\\"upload\\\"\\nPATH_FIELD_KEYS = {\\\"filename\\\", \\\"pdf_path\\\", \\\"File Path\\\"}\\n\\n\\ndef deep_get(obj, path, default=None):\\n    cur = obj\\n    for key in path:\\n        try:\\n            cur = cur[key]\\n        except (KeyError, IndexError, TypeError):\\n            return default\\n    return cur\\n\\n\\ndef extract_image_url(result):\\n    fp = deep_get(result, [\\\"response\\\", \\\"workflows\\\", 0, \\\"branches\\\", 0, \\\"nodes\\\", 0, \\\"children\\\", 0, \\\"children\\\", 0, \\\"tracking\\\", \\\"parameters\\\", \\\"file_path\\\"])\\n    if isinstance(fp, str):\\n        m = re.search(r\\\"https?://\\\\S+\\\", fp)\\n        return m.group(0) if m else None\\n    return None\\n\\n\\ndef replace_uploaded_path(obj, uploaded_image_path, parent_key=None):\\n    if isinstance(obj, dict):\\n        return {k: replace_uploaded_path(v, uploaded_image_path, k) for k, v in obj.items()}\\n    if isinstance(obj, list):\\n        return [replace_uploaded_path(v, uploaded_image_path, parent_key) for v in obj]\\n    if isinstance(obj, str) and (obj == \\\"<image_path_here>\\\" or (parent_key in PATH_FIELD_KEYS and obj.strip().lstrip(\\\"/\\\").startswith(\\\"upload/\\\"))):\\n        return uploaded_image_path\\n    return obj\\n\\n\\ndef assert_no_placeholder(payload):\\n    found = []\\n    def walk(v, p='root'):\\n        if isinstance(v, dict):\\n            for k, c in v.items():\\n                walk(c, f'{p}.{k}')\\n        elif isinstance(v, list):\\n            for i, c in enumerate(v):\\n                walk(c, f'{p}[{i}]')\\n        elif v == '<image_path_here>':\\n            found.append(p)\\n    walk(payload)\\n    if found:\\n        raise RuntimeError('Unreplaced placeholders: ' + ', '.join(found[:10]))\\n\\n\\ndef module_summary(resp):\\n    return {\\n        \\\"kidney_cancer_detector\\\": {\\n            \\\"Inference time\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"Inference time\\\"]),\\n            \\\"classes\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"classes\\\"]),\\n            \\\"confidence\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"confidence\\\"]),\\n        },\\n        \\\"image_analyzer\\\": {\\n            \\\"cam_metrics\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"cam_metrics\\\"]),\\n            \\\"prediction\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"prediction\\\"]),\\n            \\\"cam_explanation\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"cam_explanation\\\"]),\\n            \\\"file_path\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"file_path\\\"]),\\n        },\\n        \\\"xai\\\": {\\n            \\\"confidence_interpretation\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"confidence_interpretation\\\"]),\\n            \\\"recommended_next_steps\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"recommended_next_steps\\\"]),\\n            \\\"references\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"references\\\"]),\\n            \\\"summary\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"summary\\\"]),\\n            \\\"visual_evidence\\\": deep_get(resp, [\\\"workflows\\\",0,\\\"branches\\\",0,\\\"nodes\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"children\\\",0,\\\"tracking\\\",\\\"parameters\\\",\\\"visual_evidence\\\"]),\\n        },\\n    }\\n\\n\\ndef main():\\n    ARTIFACTS_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\n    mime = mimetypes.guess_type(str(IMAGE_PATH))[0] or 'application/octet-stream'\\n    boundary = '----OpenClawBoundary' + uuid.uuid4().hex\\n    body = b''.join([\\n        f'--{boundary}\\\\r\\\\n'.encode(),\\n        f'Content-Disposition: form-data; name=\\\"file\\\