 media URL, potentially as the first token. Using a reply tag at the beginning would be helpful, and maybe I can add the media at the end on a new line. It’s all about keeping it clear and easy to understand while providing all relevant information!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I ran the kidney pipeline on your CT image and saved the upload artifacts.\n\n**Saved artifacts**\n- Upload request: `./kidney-pipeline-artifacts/upload-request.json`\n- Upload response: `./kidney-pipeline-artifacts/upload-response.json`\n- Execution request: `./kidney-pipeline-artifacts/execution-request.json`\n- Execution response: `./kidney-pipeline-artifacts/execution-response.json`\n\n**Pipeline summary**\n- **Kidney Cancer Detector**\n  - Kidney cancer class: `kidney_tumor`\n  - Confidence: `0.9999794960021973`\n  - Inference time: `3.27 s`\n\n- **Image Analyzer**\n  - Prediction: `kidney_tumor`\n  - CAM coverage: `0.012755102040816327`\n  - CAM center ratio: `0.8249999997937499`\n  - CAM left-right asymmetry: `0.099999999975`\n  - CAM top-bottom asymmetry: `0.99999999975`\n  - CAM explanation: The model focused on a localized central renal region with asymmetric spatial distribution, which it interpreted as a visually distinct area consistent with localized structural alteration.\n\n- **X-AI**\n  - Confidence interpretation: The output reports a very high-confidence signal, but explicitly notes this is not a definitive diagnostic tool.\n  - Summary: The analysis suggests a high likelihood of kidney cancer with visual evidence of a kidney tumor.\n  - Recommended next steps:\n    1. Further medical evaluation with imaging and lab tests\n    2. Discuss the result with a medical professional\n    3. Consider additional diagnostic testing such as biopsy or genetic testing\n\nThis is a **preliminary pipeline signal, not a diagnosis**. If you want, I can also extract the raw JSON highlights into a cleaner clinical-style report.\n\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69b862e0a6fbd73a6254e5be/b0f1c107-0576-49f4-985a-1754b3411728.jpeg","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e0656b03cf29aaf0169bd8c42c4688191a35508e7467a896f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":10478,"output":504,"cacheRead":32128,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43110,"cost":{"input":0.026195000000000003,"output":0.00756,"cacheRead":0.008032,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.041787}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774029886039}}
